{"version":1,"content":"<p>【偷樑換柱 😱】Amazon 再度爆出 CPU 退貨詐騙事件！</p><p>一名海外消費者在 Amazon 購買售價高達 889 美元的頂級處理器 AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D2，拆封後卻發現收到的竟是一顆「移花接木」的偽造晶片。</p><p>疑似有不法買家將 AMD 原廠處理器開蓋（Delid）取走內部核心後，將該散熱頂蓋（IHS）黏合移植至一顆報廢或低階的舊款 Intel 處理器上，並成功通過 Amazon 退貨檢驗程序。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.000845+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:51:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T23:57:47.159272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684399+00:00","content_hash":"45bd674aff13452ba7da48a9f03e1638e3d7cb4af623530f2bcc10215642ad71","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}